Subject: [PATCH 7/9] hard_refine: coordinate descent kept (random local search
 measured equal from the same starts, 3x slower) and the random variant
 removed

Refine-only comparison from the base tracker's outputs (bench runs outline_base_*), 224-px window, 2 s cap:
frozen scorer mean left/right/back .744/.752/.756 -> descent .769/.771/.778, random .769/.772/.776;
224 score .734/.743/(-) -> .764/.767/.774 both. Descent ~0.3 s/frame, random ~0.9 s.
Python tools only; no Java build involved.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HQYiYmhRzcQpLCYMVVDQeZ
